---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Halloween Fest — Branding e Identidad Visual · Ascndr Jaén"
  description="Diseño de identidad visual completa para Halloween Fest Jaén: logo, carteles, pulseras VIP, acreditaciones y dirección creativa del evento. Proyecto de branding por Ascndr, estudio creativo en Jaén."
  canonical="https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/branding/halloweenfest"
>

<style is:global>
  @import "../../../styles/global.css";

  .project-page {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    color: #f0ece6;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
  }
  .project-nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 20px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,10,0.95), transparent);
  }
  .project-nav a {
    color: #888; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    transition: color .2s;
  }
  .project-nav a:hover { color: #f0ece6; }
  .project-nav .nav-logo {
    color: #f0ece6; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .project-hero {
    height: 70vh; min-height: 400px;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .project-hero img {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    filter: brightness(0.55);
  }
  .project-hero-content {
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
    padding: 0 40px 48px;
    width: 100%; max-width: 900px;
  }
  .project-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #888; border: 0.5px solid #333; border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 5px 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .project-title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em;
    color: #f0ece6; margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .project-subtitle {
    font-size: 14px; color: #888; letter-spacing: .04em;
  }

  .project-body {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 40px;
  }
  .project-meta {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px; margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .meta-item {
    background: #111; padding: 20px;
  }
  .meta-label {
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-size: 13px; color: #f0ece6; font-weight: 500;
  }

  .project-desc {
    font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: #aaa;
    margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 640px;
  }

  .project-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 3px; margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .project-grid img {
    width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    object-fit: cover; display: block;
    transition: filter .3s;
  }
  .project-grid img:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
  .project-grid img:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }

  .project-cta {
    border-top: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; padding-top: 48px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .cta-text { font-size: 13px; color: #555; }
  .cta-link {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: #141414; border: 0.5px solid #2a2a2a;
    border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 22px;
    color: #f0ece6; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color .2s;
  }
  .cta-link:hover { border-color: #555; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .project-nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
    .project-hero-content { padding: 0 20px 32px; }
    .project-body { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .project-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-grid img:first-child { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
    .project-cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{`
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CreativeWork",
  "name": "Halloween Fest — Branding e Identidad Visual",
  "description": "Diseño de identidad visual completa para Halloween Fest Jaén: logo, carteles, pulseras VIP, acreditaciones y dirección creativa del evento durante dos ediciones consecutivas.",
  "creator": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Ascndr", "url": "https://ascndrworld.com" },
  "url": "https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/branding/halloweenfest",
  "image": "https://ascndrworld.com/images/halloween-fest/pulsera-portada.jpg",
  "keywords": ["branding", "identidad visual", "evento", "Halloween", "Jaén", "diseño gráfico"],
  "locationCreated": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Jaén, España" },
  "dateCreated": "2024",
  "genre": "Branding · Identidad Visual · Evento"
}
`}</script>

<div class="project-page">

  <nav class="project-nav">
    <a href="/trabajos">← Trabajos</a>
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Ascndr</a>
    <a href="/#contacto" onclick="history.back()">Contacto</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="project-hero">
    <img
      src="/images/halloween-fest/pulsera-portada.jpg"
      alt="Halloween Fest Jaén — Branding e identidad visual por Ascndr"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div class="project-hero-content">
      <span class="project-tag">Branding · Identidad Visual</span>
      <h1 class="project-title">Halloween Fest</h1>
      <p class="project-subtitle">Identidad Visual · Evento · Jaén</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="project-body">

    <div class="project-meta">
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Categoría</div>
        <div class="meta-value">Branding · Evento</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Año</div>
        <div class="meta-value">MMXXIV — MMXXV</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Cliente</div>
        <div class="meta-value">Halloween Fest Jaén</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="project-desc">
      Diseño de identidad visual completa para Halloween Fest, el evento de referencia de la noche de Halloween en Jaén.
      Dos ediciones consecutivas con dirección creativa integral: logo, carteles, pulseras VIP, acreditaciones
      y todos los materiales gráficos del evento.
    </p>

    <div class="project-grid">
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/cartel-oficial.jpg" alt="Cartel oficial Halloween Fest Jaén — diseño Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/tickets.jpg" alt="Tickets Halloween Fest Jaén — branding Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/pulseras.jpg" alt="Pulseras VIP Halloween Fest Jaén — identidad visual Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/cartel-3-0.jpg" alt="Cartel 3ª edición Halloween Fest Jaén — Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/acreditacion.jpg" alt="Acreditación Halloween Fest Jaén — diseño gráfico Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
    </div>

    <div class="project-cta">
      <p class="cta-text">¿Tienes un proyecto similar?</p>
      <a href="/" class="cta-link">Hablemos →</a>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

</Layout>
